  "title": "Qt: Add extcap configuration to Welcome screen context menu",
  "description": "For extcap interfaces, add launching their configuration dialog\nto the right-click context menu in the list of interfaces on\nthe welcome screen. That is a larger amount of real estate to\npossibly click, and might be more easily discoverable to some\nusers than clicking on the extcap icon.\n\nRelated to #13287, #19817 (we need something like this to configure\nextcaps if we want to have the option of a QListView in IconMode\nfor the interfaces.)",
